program Leaderboard

Ranks a player's position on a scoreboard.

interface
  input  scores: list<integer>
  input  playerScore: integer
  output rank: integer

Requirement 1: Ranking
  THE SYSTEM SHALL return the player's rank when the scores are sorted from highest to lowest
  IF several players share a score THEN the system SHALL give them the same rank

Requirement 2: Edge cases
  IF the scoreboard is empty THEN the system SHALL return 1
